ority", "C": "Income tax office", "D": "The employee's office cash"}, "answer": "B", "i": "quydoyht7gr"}, {"q": "Death gratuity for 9 years of service is?", "options": {"A": "6 months", "B": "20 months", "C": "12 months", "D": "2 months"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q1un38t95sj4"}, {"q": "Death gratuity for 18 years of service is?", "options": {"A": "12 months", "B": "6 months", "C": "33 months", "D": "20 months"}, "answer": "D", "i": "q25jywzd9tt0"}, {"q": "Death gratuity for 30 years of service is?", "options": {"A": "30 months", "B": "20 months", "C": "12 months", "D": "33 months"}, "answer": "A", "i": "q15ev9o3clq6"}, {"q": "Death gratuity for exactly 11 years of service is?", "options": {"A": "12 months", "B": "20 months", "C": "6 months", "D": "33 months"}, "answer": "B", "i": "qfmq1xb1dk0"}, {"q": "Death gratuity for 20 years of service is?", "options": {"A": "12 months", "B": "33 months", "C": "20 months", "D": "25 months"}, "answer": "C", "i": "qunj1f9un3p"}, {"q": "Death gratuity for 21 years of service is?", "options": {"A": "20 months", "B": "12 months", "C": "33 months", "D": "21 months"}, "answer": "D", "i": "q1jix8wmi9le"}, {"q": "Delay in DCRG payment beyond the allowed period attracts?", "options": {"A": "Interest is payable", "B": "Nothing extra", "C": "It is forfeited", "D": "It is halved"}, "answer": "A", "i": "q1n1a4vvgvzn"}, {"q": "DCRG nomination is made in?", "options": {"A": "Oral nomination suffices", "B": "Prescribed form in service book", "C": "Bank form", "D": "No form needed"}, "answer": "B", "i": "q3kbah2s472"}, {"q": "Can DCRG be assigned or attached for debt?", "options": {"A": "Yes, freely", "B": "Yes, partially", "C": "No, it cannot be assigned", "D": "Only by court"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q1e6u3m0gao5"}, {"q": "DCRG is calculated on?", "options": {"A": "First pay drawn", "B": "Average of entire service", "C": "Grade pay only", "D": "Emoluments at retirement or death"}, "answer": "D", "i": "q1g8jp5wf9r7"}]